---Delete a user migration archive
---
---Deletes a previous migration archive. Downloadable migration archives are automatically deleted after seven days. Migration metadata, which is returned in the [List user migrations](https://docs.github.com/rest/migrations/users#list-user-migrations) and [Get a user migration status](https://docs.github.com/rest/migrations/users#get-a-user-migration-status) endpoints, will continue to be available even after an archive is deleted.
---
---`DELETE /user/migrations/{migration_id}/archive`
---@param input github.migrations.DeleteArchiveForAuthenticatedUserRequest
---@return github.migrations.DeleteArchiveForAuthenticatedUserResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_archive_for_authenticated_user(input) end

